---
/**
 * AXCrew page — five themes: connect, delegate, control, observe,
 * security. REST endpoints and protocol details live in the docs.
 */
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import SendWork from '../../components/SendWork.astro';
import CrewUI from '../../components/CrewUI.astro';
import Boundaries from '../../components/Boundaries.astro';
import FleetNetwork from '../../components/islands/FleetNetwork';
import { CREW_UI } from '../../lib/topology';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
import type { Lang } from '../../lib/i18n';

interface Props {
  lang?: Lang;
}

const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const z = lang === 'zh';
---

<PageHero
  kicker={z ? 'AXCrew · 代理编排' : 'AXCrew · agent orchestration'}
  title={z ? '每一台机器的控制平面。' : 'A control plane for every machine.'}
  lead={z
    ? 'AXCrew 连接你已经拥有的 AX 运行时——笔记本、服务器、GPU 机器、云虚拟机，以及口袋里的手机——并在它们之间调度确定性的工作。AX 守着循环；AXCrew 守着集群。'
    : 'AXCrew connects the AX runtimes you already have — on laptops, servers, GPU boxes, cloud VMs and a phone in your pocket — and schedules deterministic work across them. AX keeps the loop; AXCrew keeps the fleet.'}
  meta={[`v${SITE.crewVersion}`, 'control plane · desktop · android', 'ed25519 · outbound wss', z ? '持久化协作状态' : 'durable collaboration state']}
/>

<!-- ============ 01 CONNECT ============ -->
<Section
  id="connect"
  kicker={z ? '01 — connect' : '01 — connect'}
  title={z ? '一支集群，一个视图。' : 'One fleet, one view.'}
  lead={z
    ? '设备配对一次，之后从任何地方路由任务、流式接收事件、审批权限。设备只出站连接——不需要入站端口，不需要 SSH。'
    : 'Pair a device once, then route tasks, stream events and approve permissions from anywhere. Devices connect out — no inbound port, no SSH.'}
>
  <div class="panel-dark grid-bg">
    <div class="hairline-dark-b flex items-center justify-between bg-void-2 px-4 py-2.5">
      <span class="mono-micro text-fog-2">topology · live</span>
      <span class="mono-micro text-fog-2">laptop · server · gpu · cloud · mobile</span>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 sm:p-6">
      <FleetNetwork client:visible lang={lang} />
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<!-- ============ 02 DELEGATE ============ -->
<Section
  id="delegate"
  tone="paper2"
  kicker={z ? '02 — delegate' : '02 — delegate'}
  title={z ? '任务找到具备能力的 AX。' : 'Work finds a capable AX.'}
  lead={z
    ? '一个请求在笔记本上进入，被路由到构建服务器与 GPU 机器，结果回到发起方。AX 干活，AXCrew 搬运。'
    : 'One request enters on the laptop, gets routed to the build server and the GPU box, and the result comes back to the requester. AX does the work; AXCrew moves it.'}
>
  <SendWork lang={lang} />
</Section>

<!-- ============ 03 CONTROL ============ -->
<Section
  id="control"
  kicker={z ? '03 — control' : '03 — control'}
  title={z ? '桌面控制。手机审批。' : 'Desktop control. Phone approval.'}
  lead={z
    ? 'AXCrew 的桌面端与 Android 客户端连同一套 API：在桌面上调度，在口袋里审批，处处看到同一个集群。'
    : 'AXCrew\u2019s desktop app and Android client speak the same API: schedule on the desk, approve from the pocket, see the same fleet everywhere.'}
>
  <CrewUI lang={lang} />
</Section>

<!-- ============ 04 OBSERVE ============ -->
<Section
  id="observe"
  tone="dark"
  kicker={z ? '04 — observe' : '04 — observe'}
  title={z ? '一切都在一条流里。' : 'Everything, in one stream.'}
  lead={z
    ? '实时 CrewEvent：路由、工具调用、审批、结果。普通会话的事件索引保存脱敏元数据；分布式协作持久化任务、检查点与明确发布的产物，完整 Session 和 Memory 仍留在 AX。'
    : 'Live CrewEvents: routing, tool calls, approvals, results. The ordinary session event index keeps redacted metadata. Distributed collaboration persists tasks, checkpoints and published artifacts; complete Session and Memory stores stay on AX.'}
>
  <ul class="divide-y divide-line-dark border border-line-dark">
    {
      CREW_UI.desktop.events.map((e, i) => (
        <li class="term flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-3 text-fog-2 sm:px-5">
          <span class="mono-micro shrink-0 tabular-nums text-fog-2/60">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <span class="truncate">{e.line}</span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
</Section>

<!-- ============ 05 SECURITY ============ -->
<Section
  id="security"
  tone="paper2"
  kicker={z ? '05 — security' : '05 — security'}
  title={z ? '边界就是安全。' : 'The boundary is the security.'}
  lead={z
    ? '每台机器保持自己的工作区、沙箱、权限与身份。AXCrew 在它们之间路由任务与事件——从不把边界打开。'
    : 'Every machine keeps its own workspace, sandbox, permissions and identity. AXCrew routes tasks and events between them — it never opens a boundary.'}
>
  <Boundaries lang={lang} />
</Section>

<Section
  id="distributed"
  kicker={z ? 'Distributed Collaboration · AX 0.3.7 / AXCrew 0.3.3' : 'Distributed Collaboration · AX 0.3.7 / AXCrew 0.3.3'}
  title={z ? '工作流持续存在，AX 可以接替。' : 'Durable workflows, replaceable AX workers.'}
  lead={z
    ? 'Host 提供共享资源，AX Instance 提供独立能力，一个 Host 可运行多个 AX，一个 AX 可并发执行多个 Execution。AXCrew 统一管理调度、归属、租约与恢复；AX 保持现有推理与执行循环。桌面侧边栏新增专门的分布式协作管理页。'
    : 'Hosts provide shared resources; independent AX instances provide capabilities. A Host may run several AX instances, each with concurrent executions. AXCrew owns scheduling, ownership, leases and recovery; AX keeps its reasoning and execution loop. A dedicated desktop sidebar page manages collaboration.'}
>
  <div class="panel-dark p-6 sm:p-8">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm leading-8 text-fog">{z
      ? '任务分解 → 能力调度 → 跨机器执行 → Event / Artifact 回传 → 状态持久化 → 失败恢复 / 重新规划 → 继续执行'
      : 'Decompose → capability scheduling → cross-machine execution → Event / Artifact return → persisted state → recovery / replanning → continue'}</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-fog-2">{z
      ? 'Durable Task、Event、Artifact 和 Workflow State 保存在 AXCrew。各 AX 异步拉取工作，不依赖高频直接通信，也不要求任何 Coordinator Agent 持续存活。项目按逻辑身份映射到各机器路径，每次执行使用隔离工作区。现有单机 AX 与设备控制继续独立使用。'
      : 'AXCrew retains durable Tasks, Events, Artifacts and Workflow State. AX workers pull work asynchronously without direct peer communication or a permanently live Coordinator Agent. Logical project identities map to machine-local paths and isolated execution workspaces. Existing single-machine AX and device controls remain available.'}</p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-fog-2">ax crew worker worker.json</p>
  </div>
</Section>
